    "title": "MEETINGS",
    "text": "Thursday, Nov. 13\n1 p.m., the Fort Getty ad hoc committee will meet at Town Hall\n6 p.m., the school committee will meet at Town Hall\nMonday, Nov. 17\n6 p.m., the town council will meet at Town Hall. The councilors also will serve as the board of water and sewer commissioners during this session\nTuesday, Nov. 18\n7 p.m., the zoning board of review will meet at Town Hall\nWednesday, Nov. 19\n5 p.m., the affordable housing committee will meet at Town Hall\n6:30 p.m., the planning commission will meet at Town Hall",
